;Smaragd Dash: a cave of the game (tools/mkcave.py)
;Two magic floors, one above the other: walk along under the boulders
;over each of them. Nuts are mixed in with the boulders: the magic
;floor lets them through as nuts, and a boulder falling after them
;cracks them.
